WEBVTT

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:24.580
I apologize.

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:26.010
I lost it.

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:30.520
That's the eighth victim.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:48.580
<i>Asura Cryin'</i>

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:05.790
"The Youngest Daughter of the King of Misfortune"

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:13.880
Welcome home, Miss Kanade.

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:17.980
Please avoid going outdoors for a while.

00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:20.570
I just went to school.

00:02:21.630 --> 00:02:24.020
We will need you to skip school.

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.030
Leave.

00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:29.420
Miss.

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:33.100
Just leave!

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:38.500
What is that?

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:40.650
A letter from my brother.

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:42.290
What does it say?

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:45.470
Take care of the demon child.

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:46.830
Demon?

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:50.490
Yes?

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:57.790
Tomoharu, please.

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:07.930
What do you mean, guard Takatsuki?

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:10.460
Are you aware of the demon hunter...

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:12.340
...that has been causing trouble?

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:13.330
No.

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:16.060
Is it like picking strawberries or leaves?

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:18.010
Misao!

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:22.450
With powers that surpass even high ranking demons...

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:26.540
...this criminal has been indiscriminately attacking demons.

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:28.630
So Tomo needs to guard Kanade?

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:33.200
As someone who fought as an equal against Yo Susugihara...

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:36.000
...we were hoping you could protect Miss Kanade.

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:40.000
Wouldn't she be safer with the Takatsuki group protecting her?

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:41.770
It was her request.

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:45.020
I can't go to school...

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:47.510
...with my father's guards.

00:03:48.090 --> 00:03:50.040
I prefer you, Tomoharu.

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:54.580
Tomo! Something's coming!

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:01.610
What's going on?

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:06.150
Shuri?

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:15.000
Hi Tomoharu.

00:04:16.090 --> 00:04:17.690
Here's your demon child.

00:04:17.970 --> 00:04:19.370
Demon child?

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:25.380
I am Ania Fortuna Crowzenbruhi.

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:27.630
Call me Nia.

00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:33.740
So the demon child your brother wanted you to take care of is...

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:36.820
Mr. Nastume, please guard Miss Kanade.

00:04:38.110 --> 00:04:41.020
Well, Tomoharu? Which one will you take in?

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:43.020
Which?

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:44.770
How unexpected.

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:46.550
I didn't realize you were into that, Tomoharu.

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:48.490
I-I'm not!

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:49.650
I see.

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:51.910
So you're a breast man.

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:57.750
Why you...!

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:03.010
Are you okay?

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:06.690
Well.

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:08.810
I guess you'll be looking after both of them.

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:12.500
We'll be on our way, then.

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:16.010
Mr. Natsume, we're counting on you.

00:05:22.540 --> 00:05:24.720
I'll be staying with you for a while.

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:28.140
Why does everyone have to come to me?

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:32.510
I've received permission to stay here from Naotaka Nastume.

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:34.690
That's right.

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:37.940
How did you meet Naotaka?

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:42.140
When he traveled through my country last year.

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:46.950
He's one of the few people I actually respect.

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.950
So what are you doing in Japan?

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:56.140
She's going to be transferring into your class, Tomoharu.

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:57.640
She's a high school student?

00:05:57.910 --> 00:05:59.990
She's clearly an elementary school student.

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:01.800
She's a genius.

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:03.410
Skipping grades, huh?

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:08.460
The Royal Dark Society called her here.

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:12.560
The Science Club has received an official request to protect Nia.

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:14.030
Protect her?

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:16.380
You mean I have to guard her, too?

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:20.550
Yes. Whether you're guarding one or two, it's all the same, isn't it?

00:06:20.930 --> 00:06:22.550
How could it be?

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:26.010
Are the two of you dating?

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:26.830
What?

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:27.930
That's...

00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:29.020
...unacceptable!

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:30.790
Ow!

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:32.880
What was that for?

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:52.650
Are you serious?

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:54.870
I think it's her power.

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:56.470
Huh? You mean Nia's?

00:06:56.880 --> 00:07:01.050
Nia is the youngest daughter of the Fortuna, King of Misfortune.

00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:04.910
They're a long line of luck eaters.

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:11.050
So what are they? Luck eats?

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:13.850
Don't abbreviate it like that.

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:16.140
Luck eaters.

00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:21.020
They're demons with the power to absorb the luck of others.

00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:23.140
Their good luck?

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:26.450
So that explains all that unfortunate stuff that happened to you.

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:28.230
Sounds like a lot of trouble.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:32.090
It's an essential survival measure.

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:33.380
Deal with it.

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:34.720
Essential to your survival?

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:39.020
Luck eaters don't have their own luck.

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:42.090
They have to get all their luck from others.

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:45.740
So they're like Japan's petrels.

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:51.210
Not quite. Luck eaters aren't inherently evil.

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:54.210
Too much luck or misfortune...

00:07:54.210 --> 00:07:57.010
...will involve others and destroy a person.

00:07:57.460 --> 00:08:01.790
The luck eater's role is to maintain balance.

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:05.280
They're just one of the things that promote stability.

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:09.000
With the accumulated luck they gather from many people...

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:11.220
...they balance out extreme misfortune.

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:14.390
Maybe now you understand the greatness of my family.

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:17.500
Besides, I went easy on you.

00:08:17.770 --> 00:08:18.830
In simple terms...

00:08:19.170 --> 00:08:21.190
...I took someone with very good luck...

00:08:21.190 --> 00:08:23.000
...and gave them bad luck.

00:08:23.340 --> 00:08:25.900
You got a different kind of gift from above.

00:08:26.140 --> 00:08:27.300
Nice one, Misao.

00:08:28.970 --> 00:08:30.170
If that's bad luck...

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:32.690
...what happens to someone with very bad luck or worse?

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:34.030
Isn't it obvious?

00:08:34.540 --> 00:08:38.360
A person with no luck left will die an unfortunate death.

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:41.330
You sure are a demon.

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:44.540
Take care, Tomoharu.

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:47.000
Huh? Where are you going?

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:47.990
I've got something to do.

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:50.660
I'm not good with kids.

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:54.140
Watch out for the demon hunter, Nia.

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:56.080
Make sure Tomoharu's doing his job.

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:59.400
Why am I stuck with this worthless handler?

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:02.880
And what did she mean by "demon hunter?"

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:07.660
Something's been attacking demons recently.

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:11.180
The Student Union's handlers are looking for the culprit.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:13.430
It'll blow over.

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:15.820
That's not right.

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:24.800
What's this?

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:27.330
It looks like something was here once.

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:30.440
Probably a dipole amber.

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:32.440
Dipole amber?

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:36.000
It's a mineral used to control magic.

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:39.010
I've never seen one that big before.

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:42.320
You certainly have the knowledge of two people.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:46.140
I guess you would, since you let your father die.

00:09:50.170 --> 00:09:51.470
It seems our culprit...

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:54.640
...wants to control a rather significant amount of magic.

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:03.250
What is Kanade doing?

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:07.010
She's removing all the wasabi so Nia can eat.

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:08.170
I see.

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:10.280
So why do you look so down?

00:10:10.990 --> 00:10:13.630
"Receipt"

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:13.630
That's all the money I made this month down the drain.

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:28.240
I'll take this room.

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:30.500
It's a closet.

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:33.300
We can clean it up.

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:34.560
What?

00:10:49.110 --> 00:10:51.600
This is just like having a little sister.

00:10:58.770 --> 00:10:59.900
Thank you, Tomoharu.

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:02.390
Were you able to tidy up Nia's room?

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:05.460
Uh, yeah. Mostly.

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:09.120
Tomoharu, I want some sweet warm milk.

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:10.690
Why do I have to do it?

00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:14.410
Kanade isn't done drying my hair.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.320
Do it yourself.

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:18.300
You want a child to use the stove?

00:11:20.590 --> 00:11:21.720
Nia wins this round.

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:25.300
So now she's a kid?

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:28.270
Use honey instead of sugar.

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:32.370
Oh, and take off the skin before you bring it out.

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:34.210
There, there, Tomo.

00:11:45.210 --> 00:11:46.160
What?

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:50.980
Nia!

00:11:51.590 --> 00:11:53.400
Where's the bathroom?

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:55.210
Didn't I just show you?

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:57.090
I forgot.

00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:10.720
C-correct.

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.280
Where do you want to eat lunch?

00:12:20.790 --> 00:12:24.340
Hey! I heard there was another vampire incident last night.

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:27.210
It's amazing. I wonder who's behind it.

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:29.360
It's a UMA, isn't it? It must be a UMA!

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:32.020
I'm excited just be the thought...

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:33.010
Ow!

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:35.810
What?

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:37.180
You were having fun.

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:38.610
I just thought I'd take some.

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:39.840
Huh?

00:12:42.060 --> 00:12:43.970
Oh, part two!

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:47.220
Ania, did you invite them to join us?

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.220
Today, after school...

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:54.010
...let's hold a welcoming party for Ania in the Science room.

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:55.310
A welcoming party?

00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:57.190
You don't need to do that.

00:12:57.260 --> 00:12:59.410
Too bad. It's already been decided.

00:12:59.950 --> 00:13:01.700
I'll go get refreshments...

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:03.950
...so it's up to you to decorate.

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:06.960
"Science Prep Room"

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:08.730
Man, this sucks.

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:10.850
Shouldn't you be helping, Nia?

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:11.730
Okay.

00:13:12.210 --> 00:13:12.660
Huh?

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:14.120
What do you want me to do?

00:13:14.400 --> 00:13:15.800
Should I move some desks over...

00:13:17.510 --> 00:13:18.940
Are you okay?

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:21.710
Don't push yourself so hard. You're so frail.

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:23.920
Don't be so rude, projection body!

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:25.460
I'm not frail!

00:13:26.250 --> 00:13:28.330
And they say you're a genius.

00:13:29.150 --> 00:13:32.360
You're a specialist on Asura Machina, right?

00:13:32.800 --> 00:13:34.030
What kind of stuff do you study?

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:35.260
I won't tell.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:38.300
There's no need for me to tell you.

00:13:38.570 --> 00:13:40.110
I'm sure you don't have to say it like that.

00:13:41.890 --> 00:13:43.520
Is Ania Fortuna here?

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:48.650
We have some questions for you...

00:13:48.780 --> 00:13:50.390
...regarding the demon hunter.

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:51.410
What?

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:55.440
We're aware of eight cases.

00:13:56.840 --> 00:13:58.580
One victim is dead.

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:00.730
The cause of death was blood loss.

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:03.670
Three are in comas.

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:06.400
All of the victims...

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:09.130
...have been drained of large amounts of blood.

00:14:10.470 --> 00:14:12.680
But what does that have to do with Nia?

00:14:13.090 --> 00:14:15.310
I'll get to it.

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:18.730
The daughter used by the demon hunter is a slime.

00:14:19.510 --> 00:14:22.890
Slimes are daughters of the Crowzenbruhi family.

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:24.890
Isn't that right?

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:28.150
Any ideas?

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:32.830
Where is your sister Christina Fortuna?

00:14:33.240 --> 00:14:37.440
Are you saying my sister has something to do with the demon hunter?

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:47.210
Tomo!

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:52.330
Tomoharu, let's go.

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:56.080
Maybe we were a little harsh.

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:58.030
It couldn't be helped.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.880
"Welcome Nia"

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:06.160
Looks like she went easy on you.

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:09.540
Mayonnaise?

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:12.440
Oh?

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:15.040
Have the festivities started already?

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:22.480
Is she here?

00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:25.210
Forget about her.

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:26.750
We can't do that, Tomo.

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:28.590
She's only ten.

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:29.820
That's exactly why we should leave her alone.

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:33.510
We'll only spoil her by going after her.

00:15:34.020 --> 00:15:37.540
I wouldn't say she's spoiled.

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:40.440
Well, she isn't exactly an angel.

00:15:40.880 --> 00:15:42.590
What are you talking about?

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:46.140
Isn't demanding heaps of expensive food selfish?

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:51.570
I think she wanted to have photographic proof...

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:53.720
...of the hospitality she's received in Japan.

00:15:54.130 --> 00:15:55.630
She must want to show someone.

00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:59.390
Sure, but she insists on living in a particular room...

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:01.750
...and makes Takatsuki take baths with her.

00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:04.650
She probably thought it wouldn't be so scary that way.

00:16:04.850 --> 00:16:05.570
Scary?

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:07.570
Demon hunters and ghosts.

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:11.100
No matter what happens...

00:16:11.100 --> 00:16:14.790
...luck eaters can't use their powers to defend themselves.

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:19.130
So that's why she woke me up to ask for the bathroom?

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:20.220
Yup.

00:16:20.800 --> 00:16:23.700
She's just a little kid.

00:16:25.270 --> 00:16:27.010
You guys knew about this all along?

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:28.000
Yeah.

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:32.410
How do you guys know this stuff?

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:34.660
I bet Nia's feeling pretty terrible.

00:16:34.770 --> 00:16:36.400
They said some harsh things to her.

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:38.830
Why can't she act like a normal kid?

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:49.720
What?

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:53.240
We thought you might be hungry.

00:16:55.970 --> 00:16:57.300
I want candy, too.

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:59.560
I'll possess you, so you eat some.

00:16:59.970 --> 00:17:02.730
That won't help you taste it.

00:17:03.930 --> 00:17:06.320
You two sure have a strange relationship.

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:07.410
You think so?

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:09.940
You don't seem like a projection body at all.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:11.510
Really?

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:14.780
I came to investigate you.

00:17:15.060 --> 00:17:15.770
Huh?

00:17:15.980 --> 00:17:18.850
Actually, I'm here to examine...

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:21.100
...the Asura Machina that acquired the stabilizer.

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:25.100
The Fortuna family's area of expertise is the control of Asura Machina.

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:29.020
Our research focuses on the burial doll.

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:31.240
Burial dolls?

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:33.840
Is that why you came to Japan?

00:17:34.790 --> 00:17:36.470
There is another reason.

00:17:37.010 --> 00:17:40.670
I also came to look for my missing sister.

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:41.860
Missing?

00:17:42.170 --> 00:17:44.460
She had been studying at Rakurowa High School.

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:48.040
We received word she had graduated...

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:50.260
...but never heard from her after that.

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:52.690
So that's why you're here.

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:55.180
Without an opportunity like this...

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:59.860
...high ranking demons can't cross national borders.

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:01.430
But by yourself?

00:18:03.130 --> 00:18:05.010
Have you found any sign of your sister?

00:18:05.530 --> 00:18:07.850
No one will tell me anything.

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:11.330
She is kind and intelligent.

00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:12.760
I'm proud to call her my sister.

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:14.760
Everyone loves her...

00:18:15.050 --> 00:18:17.270
...and she loves everyone back.

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:19.290
That's why...

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:23.420
...there's no way she would do anything to harm demons!

00:18:23.550 --> 00:18:25.940
It's impossible!

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:32.910
You're a kid. You can cry like one.

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:44.520
Better?

00:18:50.360 --> 00:18:51.210
Tomoharu.

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:54.010
There's somewhere I want to go.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:05.420
They haven't regained consciousness.

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:09.140
What did you want with the demon hunter's victims?

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:12.080
I wanted to see them with my own eyes.

00:19:12.450 --> 00:19:14.810
I wanted to see them for myself...

00:19:14.810 --> 00:19:16.240
...before moving forward.

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:17.230
What?

00:19:17.640 --> 00:19:20.170
Investigating the connection between the demon hunter and my sister.

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:22.080
But that's...

00:19:22.490 --> 00:19:24.710
It's not an issue of whether or not they're connected.

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:27.130
It's a question of why.

00:19:28.640 --> 00:19:29.320
Nia.

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:35.350
"Emergency Entrance"

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:41.270
Excuse us, we're in a hurry.

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:43.080
Miss Kanade.

00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:44.860
The Sagara group?

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:46.630
Do you know them?

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:49.600
We work with their group.

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:50.800
They're demons.

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:53.900
Then the demon hunter...

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:08.310
Nia?

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:10.020
Did you give him some luck?

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:19.100
Push it to the river.

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:25.150
Don't let it escape!

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:34.810
Hisui!

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:41.440
Well done.

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:45.050
Not too bad for a podunk president.

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:47.890
I can take it from here.

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:55.810
That's the demon hunter!

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:07.390
Bismuth.

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:17.600
What?

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:27.290
It grew?

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:28.970
Did it get injected with magic?

00:21:35.280 --> 00:21:37.230
An Asura Cryin'...

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:25.060
"Preview"

00:23:20.690 --> 00:23:21.720
It crumbles.

00:23:21.850 --> 00:23:23.630
Everything is fine.

00:23:23.630 --> 00:23:24.790
Look, here!

00:23:24.790 --> 00:23:25.470
What a shame.

00:23:25.740 --> 00:23:26.630
Lift your head.

00:23:26.870 --> 00:23:27.660
I am...

00:23:27.830 --> 00:23:28.610
You are...

00:23:29.250 --> 00:23:30.180
...not alone.

00:23:31.960 --> 00:23:35.020
"The Impossible Taboo"
